INSERT INTO `jobs` VALUES (14,'B4',15,NULL,'jobsite','2022-07-21 22:25:08',NULL,NULL,'2022-07-21 00:00:00','2022-08-12 23:59:59','Credit Scheme Officer','SMECGD052','165','0','','Port Moresby',0,'39870.00','Yes',NULL,NULL,'Business Administration,Credit Application,Finance','Small and Medium Enterprises Corporation is mandated by Parliament through the SME Corporation Act 2014 to promote and develop the SME sector in Papua New Guinea through implementation of the National SME Policy 2016 and SME Master Plan 2016-2030.\r\n\r\nSME Corporation current has a vacant position for a Credit Scheme Officer and invites professional Papua New Guineans with relevant work experiences, qualifications, knowledge and, skills to apply for the position. Interested applicants must meet the key job requirements below.\r\n\r\nThe Credit Scheme Officer is required to assist the Coordinator Credit Scheme to research, design, develop and manage key impact programs and projects to support and promote MSME access to credit finance. The successful applicant is required to forge and build partnerships with the banks and financial institutions including other key stakeholders to facilitate MSME owners to have greater access to credit finance.','<p><strong>Key Requirements</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Must have a Bachelor’s degree in Business Administration, Economics or Commerce</li>\r\n<li>Possess a minimum of five (5);
