INSERT INTO `jobs` VALUES (385,'AM5',132,NULL,'jobsite','2023-09-24 22:42:50',NULL,NULL,'2023-09-22 00:00:00','2023-10-06 23:59:59','Production Planner - POM','PP 001','165','0','','Port Moresby',0,'0','No',NULL,NULL,'Administration,Manufacturing','We are seeking a skilled, enthusiastic, qualified and experienced individual to organize production according to demand and quality standards and, to ensure goods are produced on time for distribution in a profitable manner. The goal is to ensure the smooth and cost-efficient flow of the production operations.\r\n\r\nThis position is Port Moresby based and reports to the Supply Chain Analyst – IPB & Research.\r\n\r\nThe Role:\r\n\r\nCoordinate production planning for Biscuits, Snacks, Ice-cream cone and chocolates\r\nPlan and prioritize operations to ensure maximum performance and minimum delay.\r\nAssess manpower, equipment and raw materials requirement needed to cover production demand.\r\nSchedule shift according to production needs and work within the planning budgets\r\nMonitor jobs to ensure timely completion and within budget.\r\nAddress issues when they arise aiming for minimum disruption.\r\nObtain output information (number of finished products, percentage of defectives etc.);
INSERT INTO `jobs` VALUES (FG & Raw Material);
INSERT INTO `jobs` VALUES (386,'AM6',97,NULL,'jobsite','2023-09-25 16:50:41',NULL,NULL,'2023-09-25 00:00:00','2023-10-09 23:59:59','Legal Analyst - Port Moresby','LA 001','165','0','','Port Moresby',0,'0','No',NULL,NULL,'Legal Administration','Are you a detail-oriented and knowledgeable Legal Analyst seeking an exciting opportunity to contribute your expertise to a leading FMCG company? If so, CPL Group invites you to join our dynamic team.\r\n\r\nAs a Legal Analyst at CPL Group, you will play a pivotal role in ensuring that our business practices adhere to relevant laws and regulations. You will provide expert legal advice, conduct research, and assist in contract management to support our legal and compliance functions.\r\n\r\nDUTIES AND RESPONSIBILITIES\r\n\r\nLegal Research: Conduct in-depth legal research to stay current with relevant laws and regulations affecting the FMCG industry.\r\nContract Review: Review and analyze contracts, agreements, and legal documents to ensure compliance with company policies and legal standards.\r\nRegulatory Compliance: Monitor changes in laws and regulations related to FMCG and advise the company on compliance requirements.\r\nDocumentation: Maintain accurate and organized legal records, contracts, and documentation.\r\nLegal Support: Provide legal support to various departments within the organization, including HR, procurement, and operations.\r\nRisk Assessment: Identify and assess legal risks associated with business decisions and recommend risk mitigation strategies.\r\nLitigation Support: Assist in managing legal disputes and litigation matters.','REQUIREMENTS AND QUALIFICATIONS<br /><br />Bachelor\'s degree in Law or related field; advanced degree or legal certification is a plus.<br />Proven experience as a Legal Analyst or in a similar legal role within the FMCG industry.<br />Strong understanding of FMCG industry regulations and legal standards.<br />Exceptional research and analytical skills.<br />Excellent written and verbal communication abilities.<br />Ability to work collaboratively within cross-functional teams.<br />Detail-oriented and highly organized.<br />Proficiency in legal research tools and software.<br /><br />If you have the skills and key requirements as listed, please send a brief cover letter addressing your relevant experience with your updated CV. <br /><br />Only short-listed candidates will be contacted for an interview.<br /><br />All applicants should apply by email only with Position Vacant – Legal Analyst in the subject line to:<br /><br />The Recruitment Officer – People & Culture<br /><br />CPL Group, <br />PO Box 1663, <br />Port Moresby, <br />National Capital District, <br /><br />E-mail: careers@cpl.com.pg<br /><br />Applications close 5:00pm on Monday, October 09, 2023','1','Yes','0','','14','Yes','Yes','','',0,0.000000,0.000000,'No');
