INSERT INTO `jobs` VALUES (480,'AW0',163,NULL,'jobsite','2023-10-13 19:20:46','2023-10-13 19:26:32',NULL,'2023-10-13 00:00:00','2023-11-30 23:59:59','Senior Civil Engineers x 5','JBS 001','165','0','','Vanimo, Kerema, Manus, Port Moresby,',0,'0','No',NULL,NULL,'Civil Engineering','JBS Consulting Engineers as a firm was established in 2009, Brisbane City, Australia by a PNG National, Justin B Sarimbu, a Civil Engineer who had developed professionally in the field of civil engineering and construction project delivery. He had arrived at a point in his professional career where he could make the decision to continue to provide service to his employers or to embark on the journey of starting his own consulting engineering and project management business. Mr. Sarimbu chose the latter and offered his sole civil consulting services to clients around Central Queensland, anchored out of its Caboolture Shire office, 45 minutes North of Brisbane City, Australia. In 2004, Mr. Sarimbu migrated to Australia as a Professional Civil Engineer. \r\n\r\nEarly 2013, Port Moresby City, PNG; Mr. Sarimbu invited a select like-minded industry professionals and banded a team to offer to clients all facets of professional design and project management services in areas of Civil, Mechanical, Electrical, Mining, Architecture, Building, and Petroleum projects. JBS Consulting Engineers is now a Papua New Guinean business employing multiracial project delivery professionals in Design and Project Management across a broad spectrum of projects in Australia, PNG, Fiji, Vanuatu and Solomon Islands. We now have 20 fulltime Resident Engineers and 15 Support Staff. \r\n\r\nJBS place the interests of its clients first. We work closely with our clients and partners to achieve superior quality programmed outcomes and to deliver best practice solutions that are economically competitive, ecofriendly, sustainable and add value for all stakeholders through a collaborative approach. All projects are guided from the initial steps to completion with senior project managers of the firm overseeing each aspect personally at every phase. JBS Consulting Engineers also assist its clients in obtaining federal, state, council and municipal permits. In addition, firm makes the appropriate presentations for its clients before zoning and site planning boards and agencies to ensure all projects are legally within the bounds of law to deliver. We denounce Fraud, Corruption, Terrorism,Child Labor but encourage Gender Equality and respect for everyone despite of race, color, religion and sex\r\n\r\nWe are seeking to recruit suitable candidates for Senior Civil Engineer to join us on our exciting Highway/Bridge projects across 15 Provinces in Papua New Guinea. \r\n\r\nWe require Resident Engineers roles are immediately available;\r\n\r\n1. 1x Vanimo Based\r\n2. 1x Kerema Based\r\n3. 1x Central Based\r\n4. 1x Manus Based\r\n5. 1x Port Moresby Based','Requirements;<br /><br />A bachelor\'s degree in civil engineering or a related field from a recognized tetiery institution.<br />At least 10 years of relevant work experience in civil engineering projects.<br />Member of the Institute of Engineers PNG<br />Experience in managing and supervising civil engineering projects, including budgeting, scheduling, quality control, and contract administration.<br />Proficiency in using computer-aided design (CAD);
