INSERT INTO `jobs` VALUES (485,'AW5',57,NULL,'jobsite','2023-10-13 21:29:27',NULL,NULL,'2023-10-13 00:00:00','2023-10-20 23:59:59','School of Medicine & Health Sciences x 15','UPNG 001','165','0','','Port Moresby',0,'0','No',NULL,NULL,'Medical,Lecture','The University of Papua New Guinea, is an independent, statutory Institution of Higher Education, established by The University of Papua New Guinea Ordinance 1965, confirmed by the University of PNG Act No. 18 of 1983.The University is dedicated to the pursuit, advancement and dissemination of knowledge, understanding and wisdom.\r\n\r\nThe University is currently undergoing significant infrastructure and service improvement initiatives as it strives to reform, reposition and transform the University into an influential, global academic institution. It envisions to build capacity and capability of the workforce and is immediately seeking to employ suitably qualified and experienced Career Professionals to fill the following positions at the School Medicine & Health Science (Taurama Campus);
