INSERT INTO `jobs` VALUES (537,'BB7',174,NULL,'jobsite','2023-11-03 16:10:57',NULL,NULL,'2023-11-03 00:00:00','2023-11-10 23:59:59','1x Management Accountant','IRC 001','165','0','','Port Moresby',0,'0','No',NULL,NULL,'Accounting,Taxation','The Internal Revenue Commission Act 2014 establishes the IRC as a Statutory Authority and the “Commission” consisting of the Commissioner General and the Commissioners, as the governing body of the IRC. The Internal Revenue Commission is responsible for the collection of most of PNG’s Tax Revenue.\r\n\r\nThe Commission is seeking qualified and experienced Finance & Accounting professionals with enthusiasm and drive to make positive contributions to IRC’s revenue collection objectives. The Commission has vacancies within the Finance & Accounting Division based in Port Moresby - HQ.\r\n\r\n1x MANAGEMENT ACCOUNTANT\r\n\r\nPURPOSE\r\nTo collate, prepare and analyse timely key financial information and provide effective, accurate and appropriate management and financial reports that will aid managerial planning and business decisions for the IRC. Support the division and be responsible for the accuracy, completeness and timeliness of all internal and external IRC Financial Information that are the responsibility of Finance and Accounting Division.\r\n\r\nKEY RESPONSIBILITIES\r\n\r\nPrepare Annual Financial Statements (AFS);
