INSERT INTO `jobs` VALUES (692,'BR2',48,NULL,'jobsite','2023-12-21 16:15:49',NULL,NULL,'2023-12-21 00:00:00','2024-01-04 23:59:59','Planners','HV 012','165','0','','Hidden Valley',0,'0','No',NULL,NULL,'Mechanical,Electrical,tradesman','We are seeking to recruit Planners for our Fixed Plant Maintenance – OLC & Crusher Department. Reporting to the Planning Specialist, the successful applicant will mainly be responsible for developing maintenance plans and activities for the plant, to implementing maintenance strategies and initiatives and management of maintenance policies and procedures.\r\n\r\nKey roles and responsibilities include:\r\n\r\nStrategic execution of the planning process for the weekly execution schedule.\r\nPlanning of all work, including the forward log, by taking weekly schedules from the initial stages by developing detailed job scopes and preparation of estimates, through to the execution, completion and analyse steps of the work management process.\r\nLiaise with Health and Safety Department as necessary for review, approval and the designation of the safety procedures to be used during the execution of the weekly schedule.\r\nInspect plant equipment to assess the scope of work, and determine and specialised requirements, trade resources, materials/spare parts, tools, and special equipment needed to complete the job. Remain informed on all machine and component reliability issues.\r\nEnsures that the Parts Supply Advisor receives and stages all planned Work Order material and parts.\r\nProvides assistance to ensure continuous development of SWPs (Safe Working Procedures);
