INSERT INTO `jobseeker_resume1` VALUES (1743,24547,'Chris Geno','With a strong background in customs and accounting, combined with an advanced diploma in Accounting, I bring a wealth of knowledge and expertise to any organization. Throughout my career, I have gained extensive experience in managing customs processes, ensuring compliance with regulations, and optimizing financial operations.\r\n\r\nIn my role, I have successfully handled various customs-related tasks such as preparing and submitting import and export documentation, calculating duties and taxes, and coordinating with customs authorities to resolve any issues or discrepancies. I possess a thorough understanding of customs regulations and procedures, allowing me to navigate complex customs requirements efficiently.\r\n\r\nFurthermore, my advanced diploma in Accounting has equipped me with a comprehensive understanding of financial principles, practices, and reporting. I am skilled in analyzing financial data, preparing financial statements, and maintaining accurate records. I am well-versed in utilizing accounting software and have a strong attention to detail, ensuring the accuracy and integrity of financial information.\r\n\r\nThroughout my career, I have demonstrated excellent organizational skills, the ability to meet deadlines, and a commitment to delivering high-quality results. I am a proactive problem solver, always seeking opportunities to streamline processes and enhance efficiency. Additionally, I am a strong team player, capable of collaborating effectively with cross-functional teams and stakeholders.\r\n\r\nOverall, my combination of customs experience and accounting qualifications makes me a valuable asset to any organization in need of a professional who can effectively manage customs procedures, ensure compliance, and maintain accurate financial records. I am eager to contribute my skills and expertise to contribute to the success of your organization.','3,1,4',6,'40,000','Year','Administration, Accounting,','21,1,16,42,36','Yes','165',3,0,0,'2023-10-26','20231026042332Chris_K_Geno_2023_recent_updated_CV.pdf','','','Date of Birth: 15th April 1995\r\n<div>Age: 27</div>\r\n<div>Gender: Male</div>\r\n<div>Place of origin: Pelagai, Aroma Coast, Central Province</div>\r\n<div>Nationality: Papua New Guinean&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>Vaccination status: fully vaccinated (J&amp;J);
